  "description": "VUCXEZ crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 4/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C144 H168 N16 O42 Tb9 1-,H3 O1 1+,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 10 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb9 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 20 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.578-5.075 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 85.58-172.56°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C144H177Tb9N16O46. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 μ5-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
